      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The University of British Columbia, founded in 1908 and opened in 1915, reshaped Point Grey’s ecology with roads and new housing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
